                    <div class="col-xl-4 col-lg-6">
                        <img src="https://informinvestor.cmda.gov.mv/storage/uploads/bVw9aLwv/c/iu9ur0t2-preview.jpg" alt="" class="mb-lg-0 mb-4">
                    </div>

                    
                    <div class="col-xl-8 col-lg-6 align-self-center" id="profile-info">
                        
                        <h4 class="text-primary mb-2 text-center text-lg-start">Ms. Moza Mohd A Y Darwish</h4>
                        
                        <h6 class="text-secondary fw-normal text-center text-lg-start" id="designation">Independent, Non-Executive Director</h6>

















                    

                            <p class="text-gray-500">
                                                                                                                                        <div class="page-block paragraph-block mb-4">
    <div class="text-justify">
    Ms. Moza Mohd A Y Darwish is an
Independent, Non-Executive Director, effective from December 2021. She was
re-appointed during the AGM held on 9th March 2025. She is also the
Chairperson of the Audit &amp; Risk Management Committee and a member of the
Nomination &amp; Remuneration Committee of Ooredoo Maldives.
    </div>
</div>
                                                                                                        <div class="page-block paragraph-block mb-4">
    <div class="text-justify">
    Ms. Darwish has over 15 years of
experience in the telecommunications industry specially in the areas of
Corporate Finance, Budgeting, Treasury, Strategy and Performance Management.
She currently holds the position of Director - FPP &amp; Adjacencies at Ooredoo
Group and she has previously held senior key positions including Assistant
Director Financial Planning and Performance Management, Financial Planning and
Budgeting Senior Manager, Corporate Finance Senior Analyst, Treasury Analyst at
Ooredoo Group.
    </div>
</div>
                                                                                                        <div class="page-block paragraph-block mb-4">
    <div class="text-justify">
    Ms. Darwish has completed the HEC
Paris Specialized Masters Program - Strategic Business Unit Management and the
Qatar Leadership Program.
    </div>
</div>
                                                            </p>

                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>
                                                    <div class="col-lg-3 col-md-6 profile-card" data-bs-toggle="modal" data-bs-target="#member_159">
    <div class="card shadow-sm mb-2">
        <div class="card-body p-4">
            
            <img src="https://informinvestor.cmda.gov.mv/storage/uploads/74w8O6oK/c/rfikoyud-profile-preview.png" alt="" class="mb-4">
            
            <h4 class="text-primary mb-2">Mr. Saim Yaksan</h4>
            
            <h6 class="text-secondary fw-normal">Independent, Non-Executive Director</h6>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>


<div class="modal fade profile-modal" id="member_159" tabindex="-1" aria-labelledby="exampleModalLabel" aria-hidden="true">
    <div class="modal-dialog modal-dialog-centered modal-xl modal-dialog-scrollable">
        <div class="modal-content">
            <div class="modal-body">
                <div class="row">

                    
                    <div class="col-xl-4 col-lg-6">
                        <img src="https://informinvestor.cmda.gov.mv/storage/uploads/74w8O6oK/c/rfikoyud-preview.jpg" alt="" class="mb-lg-0 mb-4">
                    </div>

                    
                    <div class="col-xl-8 col-lg-6 align-self-center" id="profile-info">
                        
                        <h4 class="text-primary mb-2 text-center text-lg-start">Mr. Saim Yaksan</h4>
                        
                        <h6 class="text-secondary fw-normal text-center text-lg-start" id="designation">Independent, Non-Executive Director</h6>

















                    

                            <p class="text-gray-500">
                                                                                                                                        <div class="page-block paragraph-block mb-4">
    <div class="text-justify">
    Mr. Saim Yaksan is an Independent,
Non-Executive Director, effective from August 2026. He is also the Chairman of
the Nomination &amp; Remuneration Committee and a member of Audit &amp; Risk
Management Committee of Ooredoo Maldives.
    </div>
</div>
                                                                                                        <div class="page-block paragraph-block mb-4">
    <div class="text-justify">
    Mr. Yaksan is a seasoned global
executive with over 25 years of international leadership experience across
procurement, business transformation, digitalization and operational
excellence. He has extensive expertise in leading large-scale transformation
programs, driving organizational efficiency, and delivering sustainable
business growth across the telecommunications, financial services, ICT,
insurance, and consulting sectors. He has worked in markets across Europe,
Middle East, Asia, Africa and Australia leading complex multinational organizations.
    </div>
</div>
                                                                                                        <div class="page-block paragraph-block mb-4">
    <div class="text-justify">
    Mr. Yaksan joined Ooredoo in 2021 as
Group Chief Transformation Officer and Acting Group Chief Procurement Officer
leading Ooredoo' s business transformation program resulting in strong
improvement across multiple business domains, and he assumed the role of Group
Chief Procurement Officer in 2025. He continues to lead procurement initiatives
across Ooredoo's operating companies, delivering significant improvements in
free cash flow, digitalization, procurement efficiency, and organizational performance.

    </div>
</div>
                                                                                                        <div class="page-block paragraph-block mb-4">
    <div class="text-justify">
    Prior to joining Ooredoo Group, he
was a Senior Vice President at McKinsey &amp; Company, where he advised clients
across the telecommunications, financial services, ICT, and insurance sectors
on business transformation and procurement excellence. Additionally. He held
several senior executive positions at MTN Group, including Chief Procurement
Officer, Chief Executive Officer of MTN Cameroon, and Chief Transformation
Officer, where he led strategic sourcing, operational transformation, and business
turnaround initiatives across multiple markets. He also held a number of
leadership roles within Vodafone across Luxembourg, Hungary, United Kingdom and
Germany.
    </div>
</div>
                                                                                                        <div class="page-block paragraph-block mb-4">
    <div class="text-justify">
    Mr. Yaksan holds a Master’s degree
in Business Administration from the University of Cologne, Germany and
participated in Erasmus scholarship program studying at Dublin City University,
Ireland.
    </div>
</div>
                                                            </p>

                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>
