                        <h4 class="text-primary mb-2 text-center text-lg-start">Mr. Abdulla Ali</h4>
                        
                        <h6 class="text-secondary fw-normal text-center text-lg-start" id="designation">Independent, Non-Executive Director</h6>

















                    

                            <p class="text-gray-500">
                                                                                                                                        <div class="page-block paragraph-block mb-4">
    <div class="text-justify">
    Mr. Abdulla
Ali is an Independent, Non-Executive Director elected by the general Shareholders
at the Annual General Meeting held on 4th March 2026.
    </div>
</div>
                                                                                                        <div class="page-block paragraph-block mb-4">
    <div class="text-justify">
    Mr. Ali
currently serves as the Programming Coordinator at the Asian Development Bank
(Maldives). He has previously held several senior positions, including Director
General at the Ministry of Finance and Treasury, and Alternate Governor of the
Maldives to the Asian Development Bank. Additionally, he has served as a Board
Director of the Maldives Pension Administration Office. Mr. Ali brings
experience in macroeconomic monitoring, public financial management, debt
management, and public policies. 
    </div>
</div>
                                                                                                        <div class="page-block paragraph-block mb-4">
    <div class="text-justify">
    Mr. Ali
holds a Master of Public Policy from the London School of Economics and
Political Science (United Kingdom), a Master of Arts in Economics from
Eastern Michigan University (United States of America), and a Bachelor of Arts
in Accounting &amp; Finance from the University of Wales, Bangor (United
Kingdom).
    </div>
</div>
                                                            </p>

