<div class="modal fade profile-modal" id="member_27" tabindex="-1" aria-labelledby="exampleModalLabel" aria-hidden="true">
    <div class="modal-dialog modal-dialog-centered modal-xl modal-dialog-scrollable">
        <div class="modal-content">
            <div class="modal-body">
                <div class="row">

                    
                    <div class="col-xl-4 col-lg-6">
                        <img src="https://informinvestor.cmda.gov.mv/storage/uploads/vgo0WKqZ/c/wy9pplo8-preview.jpg" alt="" class="mb-lg-0 mb-4">
                    </div>

                    
                    <div class="col-xl-8 col-lg-6 align-self-center" id="profile-info">
                        
                        <h4 class="text-primary mb-2 text-center text-lg-start">Mr. Khalid Hassan M A Al-Hamadi</h4>
                        
                        <h6 class="text-secondary fw-normal text-center text-lg-start" id="designation">Non-Independent, Non-Executive Director</h6>

















                    

                            <p class="text-gray-500">
                                                                                                                                        <div class="page-block paragraph-block mb-4">
    <div class="text-justify">
    Mr. Khalid Hassan M A Al-Hamadi serves as an Non-Independent,
Non-Executive Director, effective from August 2026. He is also a member of the
Audit &amp; Risk Management Committee and the Nomination &amp; Remuneration
Committee of Ooredoo Maldives.
    </div>
</div>
                                                                                                        <div class="page-block paragraph-block mb-4">
    <div class="text-justify">
    From February 2022 to January 2026, Mr. Al-Hamadi served as
the Managing Director and Chief Executive Officer of Ooredoo Maldives, where he
led the company's growth through digital transformation, innovative
technologies, and customer-centric initiatives. During this period, he also
served as the Managing Director and Chief Executive Officer of WARF Telecom
International Pvt. Ltd. Since joining Ooredoo Qatar in 2008, Mr. Al-Hamadi has
held several senior leadership positions, including Senior Director in Consumer
Sales and Assistant Director of Planning &amp; Development, where he was
leading and driving commercial strategy, business planning, organizational
transformation, and revenue growth. He currently serves as the Chief Executive
Officer of Ooredoo Fibre Networks and the Managing Director and Chief Executive
Officer of Techfin Maldives Pvt. Ltd., leading the development of
next-generation digital infrastructure and technology solutions.
    </div>
</div>
                                                                                                        <div class="page-block paragraph-block mb-4">
    <div class="text-justify">
    Mr. Al-Hamadi has extensive experience of different
industries and has held several senior positions. He brings a rich experience
of over 15 years in the Oil and Gas industry with international experience. He
has worked with General Electric in Florence, Italy, where he used to be the
Head of Planning and Strategy and was key to implementing the reorganization
initiative in Sales and Service. Mr. Al-Hamadi is an experienced and a
certified Quality Auditor with distinguishing knowledge about management system,
creative initiatives, continuous improvement, processes implementation,
statistical analysis and is a certified training manager.
    </div>
</div>
                                                                                                        <div class="page-block paragraph-block mb-4">
    <div class="text-justify">
    &nbsp;Mr. Al-Hamadi has a Bachelor of Science in System
Engineering from the University of Arizona.
    </div>
</div>
                                                            </p>

                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>
